{"type":"text","id":"h1t","x":100,"y":146,"width":520,"height":32,"text":"缓存穿透  Cache Penetration","originalText":"缓存穿透  Cache Penetration","fontSize":22,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#c2410c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":503,"version":1,"versionNonce":503,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
{"type":"text","id":"c1","x":100,"y":220,"width":520,"height":190,"text":"关键：数据根本不存在\n\n• 查询缓存与 DB 中都不存在的数据（如 id=-1）\n• 缓存永远不命中，每次都直击数据库\n• 常被恶意请求利用，瞬间压垮 DB","originalText":"关键：数据根本不存在\n\n• 查询缓存与 DB 中都不存在的数据（如 id=-1）\n• 缓存永远不命中，每次都直击数据库\n• 常被恶意请求利用，瞬间压垮 DB","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":504,"version":1,"versionNonce":504,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},
{"type":"rectangle","id":"s1","x":80,"y":430,"width":560,"height":230,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":505,"version":1,"versionNonce":505,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
{"type":"text","id":"s1t","x":100,"y":450,"width":520,"height":190,"text":"解决方案\n\n• 布隆过滤器：请求前拦截一定不存在的 key\n• 缓存空对象：对空结果也缓存（设短 TTL）\n• 接口层做参数校验 + 限流","originalText":"解决方案\n\n• 布隆过滤器：请求前拦截一定不存在的 key\n• 缓存空对象：对空结果也缓存（设短 TTL）\n• 接口层做参数校验 + 限流","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#065f46","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":506,"version":1,"versionNonce":506,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},
{"type":"rectangle","id":"h2","x":700,"y":130,"width":560,"height":64,"strokeColor":"#c2410c","backgroundColor":"#fed7aa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":512,"version":1,"versionNonce":512,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
{"type":"text","id":"h2t","x":720,"y":146,"width":520,"height":32,"text":"缓存击穿  Cache Breakdown","originalText":"缓存击穿  Cache Breakdown","fontSize":22,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#c2410c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":513,"version":1,"versionNonce":513,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
{"type":"text","id":"c2","x":720,"y":220,"width":520,"height":190,"text":"关键：单个热点 key 失效\n\n• 某个热点 key 在过期瞬间失效\n• 大量并发请求同时穿过缓存打到 DB\n• 区别于雪崩：只是「一个」热点 key","originalText":"关键：单个热点 key 失效\n\n• 某个热点 key 在过期瞬间失效\n• 大量并发请求同时穿过缓存打到 DB\n• 区别于雪崩：只是「一个」热点 key","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":514,"version":1,"versionNonce":514,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},
{"type":"rectangle","id":"s2","x":700,"y":430,"width":560,"height":230,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":515,"version":1,"versionNonce":515,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
{"type":"text","id":"s2t","x":720,"y":450,"width":520,"height":190,"text":"解决方案\n\n• 互斥锁：只放一个线程去重建缓存\n• 逻辑过期：热点数据不设物理过期\n• 提前预热 + 后台异步续期","originalText":"解决方案\n\n• 互斥锁：只放一个线程去重建缓存\n• 逻辑过期：热点数据不设物理过期\n• 提前预热 + 后台异步续期","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#065f46","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":516,"version":1,"versionNonce":516,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},
