{"type":"text","id":"h3t","x":1340,"y":146,"width":520,"height":32,"text":"缓存雪崩  Cache Avalanche","originalText":"缓存雪崩  Cache Avalanche","fontSize":22,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#c2410c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":523,"version":1,"versionNonce":523,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
{"type":"text","id":"c3","x":1340,"y":220,"width":520,"height":190,"text":"关键：大规模同时失效\n\n• 大量 key 在同一时刻集体过期\n• 或 Redis 实例整体宕机不可用\n• 流量全部涌向 DB，引发连锁崩溃","originalText":"关键：大规模同时失效\n\n• 大量 key 在同一时刻集体过期\n• 或 Redis 实例整体宕机不可用\n• 流量全部涌向 DB，引发连锁崩溃","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":524,"version":1,"versionNonce":524,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},
{"type":"rectangle","id":"s3","x":1320,"y":430,"width":560,"height":230,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":525,"version":1,"versionNonce":525,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
{"type":"text","id":"s3t","x":1340,"y":450,"width":520,"height":190,"text":"解决方案\n\n• 过期时间加随机值，分散失效时间点\n• 集群 / 主从 + 哨兵保证高可用\n• 熔断降级 + 限流兜底\n• 多级缓存（本地 Caffeine + Redis）","originalText":"解决方案\n\n• 过期时间加随机值，分散失效时间点\n• 集群 / 主从 + 哨兵保证高可用\n• 熔断降级 + 限流兜底\n• 多级缓存（本地 Caffeine + Redis）","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#065f46","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":526,"version":1,"versionNonce":526,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},
{"type":"text","id":"foot","x":80,"y":690,"width":1800,"height":24,"text":"一句话区分：穿透 = 数据不存在（缓存 + DB 都查不到）；击穿 = 单个热点 key 过期；雪崩 = 大量 key 同时过期或 Redis 宕机","originalText":"一句话区分：穿透 = 数据不存在（缓存 + DB 都查不到）；击穿 = 单个热点 key 过期；雪崩 = 大量 key 同时过期或 Redis 宕机","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#c2410c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":530,"version":1,"versionNonce":530,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
